Subject: v2: swap CTransaction and BlockMerkleRoot to V2 v7 wire format

Swaps CTransaction, CMutableTransaction, CTxIn, CTxOut, coins, tx_check,
tx_verify, and BlockMerkleRoot to V2 v7 transactions, dual TxId/TxHash,
and V2 TransactionRoot commitments, and updates transaction/merkle unit
tests and bitcoin-tx utility vectors.
